# Results (code: `code/quad.py`, `code/supplement.py`; numpy/scipy/mpmath, double precision, exact integrals e-1, atan(5)/5, 2/3)

Files: `errors.csv` (3 functions x 3 rules x k=1..12, n=2^k, absolute error), `fits.csv` (table), `results.json` (errors, fits, threshold sensitivity), `supplement.json` (local orders log2(e_k/e_{k+1}); 50-digit Simpson/GL errors for exp, Runge).

Conventions: Simpson = composite over n panels, each panel uses its endpoints and midpoint (2n subintervals). GL = n panels x 4 nodes (`leggauss(4)`). Fit: OLS of ln(err) on ln(n) over points with err > 1e-15 (~4.5 eps; absolute, integrals are O(1)); order = -slope; 95% CI = slope ± t_{0.975, m-2} * SE (needs m >= 3 points). Threshold sensitivity (1e-16, 1e-14, 1e-13) is in `results.json`.

